# Improve LLM apps (AI Hero)

When working on LLM-powered behavior (prompts, model choice, agents, tools, RAG, structured outputs, or evals):

1. Read and follow [`.cursor/skills/improve-llm-app/SKILL.md`](../skills/improve-llm-app/SKILL.md).
2. Define measurable success criteria and a baseline before changing the system.
3. Prefer the simplest staircase technique that fits; do not jump to RAG, open agents, or fine-tuning without exhausting simpler steps.
4. Re-run evals after changes; do not claim improvement without measurement.
5. In this repo: discover [`backend/evals/`](../../backend/evals/) for golden pass %, and use `LLM_TRACE` / Agent steps (see [`docs/LLM-EVALS-OBS.md`](../../docs/LLM-EVALS-OBS.md)) to capture failure modes before climbing the staircase.

Full technique list and eval types: skill refs `techniques.md`, `evals.md`, `SOURCE.md` (AI Hero).
